# Mambo A Go-Go (GQA40 VER. JAB), Konami 2001: test mode's I/O CHECK, from what mamboagg-install left (its NVRAM).
# NOTE 605: Test at 1500; attract by ~5000; Test at 6000 opens the MAIN MENU on GAME MODE; Select
# right (P1 Right) to I/O CHECK, Start. Then each of the 18 conga sensors in turn, held 30 frames,
# with a snapshot while it is held (the left, centre and right congas' PAD1-9 and their sensor
# maps), then Select left and right. Holding Right and pressing Start leaves it. Hashes the main RAM
# every frame, to compare HIRAKU's 573 core with MAME, and checks the input map against the game's
# own test.
game mamboagg

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 1500 press "Service Mode" 8   # NOTE 605
at 6000 press "Service Mode" 8
at 6550 press "P1 Right" 8
at 6650 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6800 press "Left Pad 1 (Top Left)" 30
at 6815 snap
at 6840 press "Left Pad 1 (Top Right)" 30
at 6855 snap
at 6880 press "Left Pad 2 (Middle Left)" 30
at 6895 snap
at 6920 press "Left Pad 2 (Bottom Left)" 30
at 6935 snap
at 6960 press "Left Pad 3 (Middle Right)" 30
at 6975 snap
at 7000 press "Left Pad 3 (Bottom Right)" 30
at 7015 snap
at 7040 press "Centre Pad 1 (Top Left)" 30
at 7055 snap
at 7080 press "Centre Pad 1 (Top Right)" 30
at 7095 snap
at 7120 press "Centre Pad 2 (Middle Left)" 30
at 7135 snap
at 7160 press "Centre Pad 2 (Bottom Left)" 30
at 7175 snap
at 7200 press "Centre Pad 3 (Middle Right)" 30
at 7215 snap
at 7240 press "Centre Pad 3 (Bottom Right)" 30
at 7255 snap
at 7280 press "Right Pad 1 (Top Left)" 30
at 7295 snap
at 7320 press "Right Pad 1 (Top Right)" 30
at 7335 snap
at 7360 press "Right Pad 2 (Middle Left)" 30
at 7375 snap
at 7400 press "Right Pad 2 (Bottom Left)" 30
at 7415 snap
at 7440 press "Right Pad 3 (Middle Right)" 30
at 7455 snap
at 7480 press "Right Pad 3 (Bottom Right)" 30
at 7495 snap
at 7520 press "P1 Left" 30
at 7535 snap
at 7560 press "P1 Right" 30
at 7575 snap
at 7600 press "P1 Right" 40
at 7610 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 7720 snap
at 7780 quit
